en-only-seven-games-hit-100k-physical-sales-all">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我们如何用马尔可夫状态、Aho-Corasick 与 CoALA 把 LLM Token 成本砍掉 90%</title><link>https://dev.to/nikhil2bhardwaj/how-we-slashed-llm-token-cost-by-90-with-markov-states-aho-corasick-coala-2pjd</link><description>针对越写越慢越贵的 AI 写作与 RPG 工具，分享一套把长对话 Token 成本压下来的状态机方案。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:47:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f86a67c09721517802c77742e100410356b51e59</guid><source url="https://dev.to/nikhil2bhardwaj/how-we-slashed-llm-token-cost-by-90-with-markov-states-aho-corasick-coala-2pjd">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>游戏引擎其实一直都是世界模型</title><link>https://dev.to/ganesh_rajendran_art/game-engines-were-world-models-all-along-1cm4</link><description>这篇系列文章的终章指出，游戏循环本质上就是世界模型的计算过程，游戏开发者早已在无意中搭建了 AI 世界模型的基础架构。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:21:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">39f73a489212a9ee75ea045e93f280518d2ac05a</guid><source url="https://dev.to/ganesh_rajendran_art/game-engines-were-world-models-all-along-1cm4">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>LLM 驱动游戏 NPC 的玩家数据隐私考量</title><link>https://dev.to/ally_wang_b2e892e2b0239f6/player-data-privacy-considerations-for-llm-driven-in-game-npcs-4kij</link><description>开放式对话 NPC 会接收玩家自由输入的文本，一旦接上外部大模型服务并涉及日志与跨境传输，隐私合规风险就得在功能上线前先想清楚。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:08:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">7115967ce22301468ed31ef8051059a9c671b0ac</guid><source url="https://dev.to/ally_wang_b2e892e2b0239f6/player-data-privacy-considerations-for-llm-driven-in-game-npcs-4kij">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Unreal Engine 6 将不再包含 Blueprints 与 Actor Gameplay Framework</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/unreal-engine-6-wont-include-blueprints-or-actor-gameplay-framework</link><description>Epic 确认 Unreal Engine 6 将弃用 Blueprints 与 Actor Gameplay Framework，改由 Verse 和新的 Scene Graph 框架接手，引擎工作流面临一次大换代。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:43:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="